Package: SA25204164
Type: Package
Title: Horseshoe Prior for Bayesian Sparse Regression
Version: 1.0
Date: 2025-12-20
Author: Xinran Wang
Maintainer: Xinran Wang <1160574378@qq.com>
Description: Implements the horseshoe prior for bayesian sparse regression 
    based on Carvalho et al. (2009). Provides both R and C++ implementations 
    of gibbs sampler for efficient posterior inference in high-dimensional 
    sparse regression problems. The horseshoe prior offers strong shrinkage 
    for noise coefficients while preserving large signals.
